Included upstream files are unmodified DAE visual meshes, URDF and MuJoCo XML.
This is a visual asset subset, not a standalone ROS/MuJoCo package; collision
STL files are not included. dg3fm-data.json is derived from the upstream URDF.

Demonstrator modifications:
- Browser rendering uses studio materials; original mesh geometry is preserved.
- Three original wide fingertips are replaced in the scene by narrow illustrative
  bolt tips; the original fingertip mesh files remain available as references.
- A central guide, variable three-jaw head holder and rotating spindle are added
  concept parts. These are NOT features supplied or endorsed by Tesollo.
- Finger motion is computed within URDF angle limits, with no contact dynamics,
  force/torque validation, collision certification or real hardware control.
- The custom tip and receiver dimensions are illustrative, not fabrication CAD.
